@GoGolf.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012

### List all clubs
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs
Accept: application/json

### Get a single club
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/1
Accept: application/json

### Should return 404
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/9999
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Shank — Thursday, open 08:00–22:00, expect 14 slots
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/1/available-slots?date=2026-09-27

### Simpact — Monday, closed, expect isOpen false
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/2/available-slots?date=2026-09-28

### Golf Bar — Saturday, open
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/3/available-slots?date=2026-10-03

### Golf Bar — Wednesday, closed
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/3/available-slots?date=2026-09-30

### Today — only future slots should appear
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/1/available-slots?date=2026-09-21

### Past date — expect 400
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/1/available-slots?date=2026-09-01

### Garbage date — expect 400 from binding
GET {{GoGolf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clubs/1/available-slots?date=banana
